See LICENSE in this directory.

RyanMusic changes, so the same stage can run inside this app:
- data.js: LIBRARY is optional. This bundle has no /l library index.
- data.js: analyseInWorker rejects. The analysis worker is not included.
- genre.js: styleOf reads track.forceStyle, so the look picker can choose a style.

Sky video loops are not included. The stage is opened with loops turned off,
so the night sky is the live aurora and haze from sky.js.
